        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Essence:</strong> Stored Energy &middot; <strong>Mutation:</strong> Reservoir</p><p><em>A translucent sac at the sternum that fills visibly and drains visibly.</em></p><table><thead><tr><th>Depth</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>When you take energy damage, store <strong>1 charge</strong> (max 3). Spend 1 as a free action to add <strong>1d4</strong> of that type to a Strike.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Max <strong>5 charges</strong>. Spending 2 adds <strong>1d6 + 2</strong> instead.</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>You also store a charge whenever you <strong>deal</strong> energy damage, once per round.</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Spend 3 charges as a two-action activity: a <strong>30-foot line</strong>, <strong>6d6</strong> of the stored type, basic Reflex against your class DC.</td></tr></tbody></table><p><em>Depth is this effect's badge. The whole Mutation switches off at Depth 3+ while the Carapace is broken.</em></p>"
        },
